nits down. Hence, $D=-2.$\n\nTherefore, $B+D=\\left(\\frac{1}{3}\\right)+(-2)=-\\frac{5}{3}.$\n\nFinally, the equation of the curve is\n\n$$\ny=\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\left(\\frac{x}{3}\\right)-2.\n$$" 13194139539078 17592186576411 false] [17592186583022 1071 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{(2x+1)^{5}}}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139539078 17592186576411 true] [17592186583022 1071 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{(2x+1)^{5}}}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139539078 17592186576411 false] [17592186583029 1071 "$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-2}\\frac{5}{{x}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$" 13194139539078 17592186576411 true] [17592186583029 1071 "${\\int }_{-\\infty }^{-2}\\frac{5}{{x}^{5}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139539078 17592186576411 false] [17592186583030 1071 "Calculate $$\n\\displaystyle \\int \\frac{6}{5{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}y.\n$$" 13194139539078 17592186576411 true] [17592186583030 1071 "Calculate $\\int \\frac{6}{5{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}y.$" 13194139539078 17592186576411 false] [17592186583034 1071 "$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{4}^{\\infty }\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{{z}^{5}}}\\,\\text{d}z=\n$$" 13194139539078 17592186576411 true] [17592186583034 1071 "${\\int }_{4}^{\\infty }\\frac{6}{\\sqrt{{z}^{5}}}\\,\\text{d}z=$" 13194139539078 17592186576411 false] [17592186583040 1071 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n$$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{54x}{({x}^{2}+3)^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x=\n$$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139539078 17592186576411 true] [17592186583040 1071 "Evaluate the following integral. Do not round the answer.\n\n${\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }\\frac{54x}{({x}^{2}+3)^{4}}\\,\\text{d}x=$\n{{field-1}}" 13194139539078 17592186576411 false] [17592186583047 1071 "Evaluate $$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{2}^{\\infty }\\frac{12}{{y}^{4}}\\,\\text{d}y.\n$$" 13194139539078 1759218657